      "content": "idk im just really worried about the hospital bill and honestly he was sleeping like this before he got sick, maybe he's just extra tired from not feeling well? the diaper thing could just be because he hasn't eaten much. if i give him some Pedialyte or even just some water and keep an eye on him tonight, is that okay? i dont wanna panic if it's not actually an emergency.",
